{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日據Moore's Law Is Dead透露，<strong>NVIDIA下一代旗艦遊戲顯卡RTX 6090可能在2027年底至2028年初推出，預計售價2500至3000美元(快科技註：約20033元人民幣)，現款旗艦RTX 5090據稱計劃在2027年結束生產。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587644.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:13:57.654601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:58:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.725254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.725254+00:00","content_hash":"d763c6bd03b1a0a431c8716b729ea0017c79b90e6933c48ca13725aae3cd476f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}